// ===================================================================
// Official MM Server Agent encryption keys
// Purpose: the MM Launcher only accepts an agent's encryption key if it matches
// the fingerprint listed here for that host and port. This stops anyone from
// pretending to be an MM server agent (fake mod lists, intercepted reports).
//
// The launcher downloads this file from GitHub every few hours and keeps a copy;
// a copy is also built into each release.
//
// Fields per agent:
//   Host         the address players' launchers use (as in the launcher's Hosts setting)
//   Port         the agent's TCP port (agent.jsonc "Port")
//   Fingerprint  printed by check-agent.bat ("Encryption key fingerprint")
//   Note         free text for maintainers; ignored by the launcher
//
// The same host and port can be listed twice with different fingerprints while a key
// is being replaced. Agents not listed here are still encrypted; the launcher just
// remembers their key the first time it sees it.
// ===================================================================
{
  "Agents": [
    { "Host": "game.misfitmercenaries.com", "Port": 2999, "Fingerprint": "YfP+cj5uaGdMRO7U45F/N75GafRsKpzbVPTqKLmpAts", "Note": "Main MM server machine (C:\\Apps\\MMServerAgent), added 2026-10-31" }
  ]
}
